    <td>Full System Multi-Jenjang (SD + SMP + SMA/SMK), Cloud VPS Server (1 Thn), Domain Sekolah, Setup Data, Training Guru, & Support 1 Tahun.</td>
    <td><b>Rp 15.000.000,-</b></td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td><b>PAKET STANDARD</b><br>(Single-Jenjang)</td>
